WEBVTT

00:10:59.947 --> 00:11:01.615
This last one.

00:11:01.657 --> 00:11:03.534
This is what I call the essayist,

00:11:03.575 --> 00:11:06.954
and this is somebody who I’m sure
were pitching to The New York Times,

00:11:06.954 --> 00:11:09.581
and The New York Times said,
“We’re full this month.”

00:11:09.581 --> 00:11:11.709
So they decided to just
DM it to me directly,

00:11:11.709 --> 00:11:13.210
and I think that's great.

00:11:13.252 --> 00:11:16.422
This went on for several
paragraphs, I will say.

00:11:16.463 --> 00:11:18.757
"Does 100 tampons really seem
that unreasonable

00:11:18.757 --> 00:11:20.342
considering that it's NASA?"

00:11:20.384 --> 00:11:21.510
Huh?

00:11:21.885 --> 00:11:23.804
"I'm male" -- No! --

00:11:23.804 --> 00:11:25.681
(Laughter)

00:11:25.723 --> 00:11:28.976
I really thought this message
was a woman, that's ... wow!